FullSpectrum

Spectrum analysis, reference curves, stereo analysis and loudness metering.

FullSpectrum is in early development. For build and usage instructions, see:
https://github.com/Munnopsis/SpectrumAnalyzerPlugin

This packaging directory is development scaffolding. Automated builds do not
currently publish signed or notarized installers. Review licensing, signing
and installation behavior before distributing packages.
